Package: Friedman
Title: Simple Tools for Comparing Changes in Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jeremy", "Foss",
           email = "jeremyfoss83@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides simple tools for comparing numerical data and
    calculating changes over time. The package is intended for students
    and beginner R users who want to summarize data and visualize
    differences between values.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
